Prior art
---------
Alarmo (https://github.com/nielsfaber/alarmo), Apache-2.0, is the reference
implementation of an alarm panel for Home Assistant and the benchmark this
project measures itself against. Foyer Home Defender is written from scratch and
contains no code from Alarmo.

